  "notable_quotes": [
    "MOF 2, with the longer pillar and suitable pore size, shows selective CO2 uptake and effective selective dye adsorption in water via size exclusion.",
    "Length mismatch between interlayer Zn···Zn distances and pillar lengths prevents formation of the common primitive cubic pcu framework.",
    "Replacing H2bdc with longer H2azdc enlarges channels from about 12.7×6.4 to 18.2×6.9 Å2 and raises solvent-accessible volume from 27.8% to 45.6%."
  ],
